# Versions of cicaid-devtools / cicaid-devtools-pro that this repo's AI
# PR review workflow installs.
#
# This lives outside .github/workflows/ on purpose: GitHub hard-blocks a
# workflow's default GITHUB_TOKEN from pushing any change under that
# directory, whatever permissions the job is granted, so a pin written
# inline in a workflow file could only ever be bumped by a PAT carrying
# the `workflow` scope. Here, the scheduled update workflow bumps it
# unattended (update-cicaid.yml; update-dependencies.yml in cicaid-pro).
#
# Managed by `cicaid setup-review-actions` and by that update workflow.
# Only KEY=<tag> lines are honoured -- both the install step and the
# updater reject anything else rather than run it.
CICAID_REF=v0.5.0
CICAID_PRO_REF=v0.14.1
